  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Resilient Growth Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program will help Fiji transition to more sustainable and resilient growth by strengthening the ability of the public sector, private sector, and communities in Fiji to respond to economic and/or climate-related shocks. The program comprises two subprograms that will (i) improve public financial management (PFM) for fiscal resilience and inclusion, (ii) strengthen the enabling environment for private sector development through finance sector reforms, and (iii) enhance climate and disaster resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
